<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-AA-</p>
<p>Chubu Electric Power Co Inc, 30 billion yen mortgaged due 2017.</p>
<p>-BB-</p>
<p>Albis Co Ltd, 30 million Swiss Francs unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
<p>Sumitomo Metal Ind Ltd, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2002.  </p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Kobe Steel Ltd, five billion yen unsecured due 2004.</p>
<p>-CCC-</p>
<p>Nichiro Corp, 10 billion yen unsecured due 2002.</p>
<p>Sodick Co Ltd, six billion yen unsecured convertible due 2001, private placement.</p>
</text>
